  "description": "To save her younger brother, Marchioness Harriet Goldlane became a substitute mate for Liam Almandine, the dying Alpha of the Almandine Pack. His mate died long ago. The pack wanted Harriet to give birth to an heir from Liam's seed so that their family would have a new leader after he died. Unfortunately, the Alpha was severely injured and could only wake up during full moon nights. Could Harriet accomplish her mission?\n\n(Source: Webtoon)",
